<title>UK: BTI sets warrants on Electricidade de Portugal.</title>
<headline>BTI sets warrants on Electricidade de Portugal.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bankers Trust International said it has issued one million American-style call on shares of Electricidade de Portugal SA.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    3,500 PTE		 PREMIUM	17.44 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     $1.81		     GEARING	10.29 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   01.JUL.98		 PAYDATE	03.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUX			 MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  3,259 PTE (174.45 PTE/USD)</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
